      <title>Stark Medical Scanner... sort of</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 05:03:55 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/</guid>
      <description>&lt;figure class=&#34;responsive-image&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img &#xA;      src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_c64e4a6c27a0b3a9.webp&#34;&#xA;      srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_a13ddbe9859e1f2f.webp 320w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_27d2a4d0070798d.webp 480w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_2503b0ef71210622.webp 768w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_c64e4a6c27a0b3a9.webp 1024w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_c175b2cabb5c85f6.webp 1366w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_323079e5b035e624.webp 1536w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_aa2d8ff5f6d0589a.webp 1920w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_cd348162beb417d6.webp 2560w, http://localhost:1313/medical-scanner/hero_hu_b61396103279e550.webp 3840w&#34;&#xA;      sizes=&#34;100vw&#34;&#xA;      width=&#34;100%&#34;&#xA;      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto; background-size: cover; background-image: url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRkwBAABXRUJQVlA4IEABAAAwBwCdASoqABcAPs1anUgjoqEVVQA7DMTgCsM9R9Vn/PBjGnyuSDfbvPwJm/lbbMwcbJUQKifTUEYCPpVTvoQDzEAAzMMHmT3jT6NjOuZs95v//ZGB&amp;#43;7i&amp;#43;/NSDFZhjx3q&amp;#43;bq1y/8XQhgfm&amp;#43;VZz/PH4qdhi8SWC&amp;#43;bkKlpPBUu4Pt9XudYIdRqm2Sggh4ZyUpT3cXyP0RKy76YHnjWpC&amp;#43;a0MWKmR3BdGqtB&amp;#43;pqMBUaX0l55JpbO1&amp;#43;pDszzcE6TU2H&amp;#43;ijoz7JTiqIDckSvE1rVU/1UvNcc02F819aiqnxqrjzLri8GV6mr5rKu0cxh5jLzq68ai0c&amp;#43;&amp;#43;PxTrpHHd3BoaIavuvhAnyXE3Zuqlgw8FKdFMITjPUideOlO0Uw&amp;#43;W/ZOITzuLT9rm24cbUyfk0k8e23oNsIdl2frbgmXoa3tAAAAA==);&#34;&#xA;      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;      decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;      alt=&#34;AI generated image of the Stark Medical Scanner&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Let’s get this out of the way — what is “gravy blood”, and who is “Damp”?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This whole project started as an inside joke. My buddy and I would say we had gravy blood whenever we overindulged in a meal. That sluggish, heavy feeling afterward? In our lore, that’s the gravy blood kicking in.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Realtime BART Arrival Display</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 09 Nov 2025 08:03:55 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/</guid>
      <description>&lt;figure class=&#34;responsive-image&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img &#xA;      src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_5437165c78e81629.webp&#34;&#xA;      srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_384d86333cef2c5f.webp 320w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_374ea9c597eb8080.webp 480w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_3b7a87d9784d7720.webp 768w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_5437165c78e81629.webp 1024w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_e8af07cb6b8db4b2.webp 1366w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_5ef2b6a07839bc46.webp 1536w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_570e686afe88de15.webp 1920w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_4ede7083b909d837.webp 2560w, http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/hero_hu_fd14a829b2d2aec3.webp 3840w&#34;&#xA;      sizes=&#34;100vw&#34;&#xA;      width=&#34;100%&#34;&#xA;      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto; background-size: cover; background-image: url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRoYAAABXRUJQVlA4IHoAAADwBACdASoqABoAPs1Mm0YjoiEYDVVUOwzE9IBkph0&amp;#43;swQUqRXXHCEMNg/eXFaeggAA/vYA55UHWY1vYfbxsBF42UESXpfwg9itQcpS7mH&amp;#43;RfsO9Y3DM&amp;#43;H8RNYNMDaT9pS7FqGCZfIfCpxI2sSo8ZLRCrgJpJ7XAecAAA==);&#34;&#xA;      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;      decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;      alt=&#34;AI generated image of the physical BART display&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I have a love-hate relationship with BART. I’m grateful for it, but let’s just say it’s not always the most reliable so it&amp;rsquo;s nice to see before hand when the train you need is due to arrive. There are plenty of projects out there that show real-time BART arrival information. This one does that too, it’s nothing groundbreaking, but I wanted to build my own version that captures the vintage BART platform sign vibe I associate with commuting between the East Bay and my job in the city.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
